Publish the native-engine app (Melee-NX-NetPlay 0.4.0) from the build computer instead of the recompiled app.
Not applied in this repository; apply on the build computer with:  git apply experiments/native-engine/frontend/update-host-native.patch
Then add to builder/systemd/melee-nx-update.service, [Service] (or a drop-in, systemctl --user edit melee-nx-update):
  Environment=MELEE_NX_UPDATE_BUILD=%h/Melee-NX-NetPlay/experiments/native-engine/frontend/app-build.sh
  Environment=MELEE_NX_UPDATE_NROS=game
  Environment=MELEE_NX_UPDATE_VERSION_FILE=experiments/native-engine/frontend/VERSION
latest.json keeps schema 1 and the "game" entry, so 0.3.x consoles offer 0.4.0 and install it in place of
sdmc:/switch/melee-nx-netplay/melee-nx-netplay.nro; without a "replays" entry they leave the Replays app alone.
